    "updated_at": "2017-03-23T05:48:09Z",
    "body": "Agreed we should probably just state that strings and byte sequences are mutable.\r\n\r\nMutable strings are very annoying in programming languages but I don't think there's much of a problem for them in specs. Maybe we should try to solicit wider opinions though especially since I can't remember why they're so bad in programming languages.",
