    "created_at": "2017-03-23T05:49:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-23T05:49:16Z",
    "body": "I guess one downside is that if we have an actual JavaScript string coming from a JavaScript program and we treat it as mutable, that is nonsensical.",
