    "created_at": "2017-03-23T06:42:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-23T06:45:36Z",
    "body": "How is this web observable? The native string type used inside Blink and WebKit is immutable, so is the JS string. As long as specs never expose the mutability in some object identity way I'm not sure it matters what's in the spec, though it doesn't really match how many implementations work.\r\n\r\n@bzbarsky",
